  "description": "Matrix primer: row-major indexing and direction arrays, spiral order with four walls, diagonals by r+c and r-c, rotate in place by transpose plus reverse, the matrix as marker state (set matrix zeroes, game of life), and row/column/box validation with bitmasks, with Go, C++, Java and Python templates.",
  "hero": {
